<h2>Asobi 1.0 (build 932)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>A one-page keyboard shortcut sheet</b> — US Letter, in the manual's design, every key a keycap. it and the PDF manual open from the foot of the manual window's sidebar (Asobi Review gets the reviewer's sheet).</li>
<li>The shortcuts chapter and the sheets now carry every menu shortcut too: &#8984;P play/pause, &#8984;&#8592;/&#8594; step, &#8984;&#8593;/&#8595; shots, &#8984;[ / &#8984;] marked frames, &#8984;\ flip, &#8679;&#8984;V voice note, &#8984;/ shortcuts, &#8984;, Settings, &#8984;? license.</li>
<li>PDF key tables: the "," key (previous compare pair) had gone missing from its row; back.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
